cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Idaten Ce100 — Pattern-Coded Magnonic Execution: credibility spine (sims, benchmark, GDS, PPA)"
abstract: >-
  Research artifact set for a pattern-coded magnonic execution architecture:
  spin-wave compute writing a persistent magnetic result pattern, read once
  at workload end. Includes mumax3/mumax+ simulation evidence (Kaggle T4),
  an ORFS/sky130hd open-flow GDS layout, an AI+chemistry benchmark, and a PPA
  ledger. Every claim is tagged (A) predicted / (E) engineering estimate /
  (S) simulated / (L) literature in PROVENANCE.md.
authors:
